# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile
@Web_HostAddress = https://localhost:8080
@Email=administrator@localhost
@Password=Administrator1!
@BearerToken= Bearer thisisatestbearertoken

# POST Users Register
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/Users/Register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{Email}}",
  "password": "{{Password}}"
}

###

# POST Users Login
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/Users/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{Email}}",
  "password": "{{Password}}"
}

###

# POST Users Refresh
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/Users/Refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}

###

# GET WeatherForecast
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/WeatherForecasts
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

# GET TodoLists
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/TodoLists
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

# POST TodoLists
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/TodoLists
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

// CreateTodoListCommand
{
  "Title": "Backlog"
}

###

# PUT TodoLists
PUT {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/TodoLists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

// UpdateTodoListCommand
{
  "Id": 1,
  "Title": "Product Backlog"
}

###

# DELETE TodoLists
DELETE {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/TodoLists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

# GET TodoItems
@PageNumber = 1
@PageSize = 10
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems?ListId=1&PageNumber={{PageNumber}}&PageSize={{PageSize}}

Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

# POST TodoItems
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

// CreateTodoItemCommand
{
  "ListId": 1,
  "Title": "Eat a burrito 🌯"
}

###

#PUT TodoItems UpdateItemDetails
PUT {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/UpdateItemDetails?Id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

// UpdateTodoItemDetailCommand
{
  "Id": 1,
  "ListId": 1,
  "Priority": 3,
  "Note": "This is a good idea!"
}

###

# PUT TodoItems
PUT {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/1
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

// UpdateTodoItemCommand
{
  "Id": 1,
  "Title": "Eat a yummy burrito 🌯",
  "Done": true
}

###

# DELETE TodoItem
DELETE {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/1
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

# ========== Mainflow 2 — Flow test (thiết kế + báo giá, CUSTOM_QUOTE_MF2) ==========
# Chuẩn bị DB: dotnet ef database update --project src/Infrastructure --startup-project src/Web
# Full tự động (admin Dev → tạo NV → khách → chat → 2 lần báo giá + GLB preview B2 → approve):
#   ./scripts/mainflow2-e2e.sh
#   (Development: DevAccount trong appsettings.Development.json — đổi mật khẩu nếu cần)
#
# Thứ tự tay (Swagger): Auth register → login khách → mainflow POST design-requests →
#   login NV → assign → quote → chi tiết + message → approve | cancel
# SignalR: /hubs/mainflow-2-design?access_token=<JWT> → JoinDesignWork(id) → sự kiện Mainflow2Event

@Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Mainflow 2 — [Guest] Đăng ký khách (chạy 1 lần / email username mới)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mf2_demo_user",
  "password": "Test@123456",
  "fullname": "Demo MF2",
  "email": "mf2_demo_user@test.local",
  "contactPhone": "0900000000"
}

### Mainflow 2 — [Customer] Login → copy token vào @CustomerToken
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mf2_demo_user",
  "password": "Test@123456"
}

### Mainflow 2 — [Staff] Login (tài khoản có Staff trong DB) → copy token vào @StaffToken
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "staff_username_here",
  "password": "staff_password_here"
}

@CustomerToken = Bearer paste_customer_jwt_here
@StaffToken = Bearer paste_staff_jwt_here
@MainflowDesignId = paste_guid_after_create

### Mainflow 2 — Tạo yêu cầu (Customer)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/mainflow-2/design-requests
Authorization: {{CustomerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mô hình robot custom",
  "requirementBrief": "Cần thiết kế khớp ảnh tham khảo, kích thước ~15cm.",
  "initialIdeaImageUrls": [
    "https://example.com/ref1.png"
  ]
}

### Mainflow 2 — Danh sách (Customer: của mình | Staff: hàng chờ + đã nhận)
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/mainflow-2/design-requests?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{StaffToken}}

### Mainflow 2 — Chi tiết + timeline + thread
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/mainflow-2/design-requests/{{MainflowDesignId}}
Authorization: {{CustomerToken}}

### Mainflow 2 — Staff tiếp nhận
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/mainflow-2/design-requests/{{MainflowDesignId}}/staff/assign
Authorization: {{StaffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Mainflow 2 — Staff gửi báo giá + file (URL đã upload B2/S3)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/mainflow-2/design-requests/{{MainflowDesignId}}/staff/quote
Authorization: {{StaffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quotedPrice": 1500000,
  "currency": "VND",
  "staffNote": "Bản v1 — chỉnh theo feedback.",
  "designFileUrls": [
    "https://example.com/design-v1.glb"
  ]
}

### Mainflow 2 — Chat / ghi chú (Customer hoặc Staff đã assign)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/mainflow-2/design-requests/{{MainflowDesignId}}/messages
Authorization: {{CustomerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Chỉnh phần đế rộng hơn 2mm.",
  "attachmentUrls": []
}

### Mainflow 2 — Khách chấp nhận báo giá
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/mainflow-2/design-requests/{{MainflowDesignId}}/approve
Authorization: {{CustomerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Mainflow 2 — Hủy
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/mainflow-2/design-requests/{{MainflowDesignId}}/cancel
Authorization: {{CustomerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

# SignalR (browser/JS): connect tới /hubs/mainflow-2-design?access_token=<JWT>
# sau đó gọi JoinDesignWork(designWorkId) — nhận sự kiện Mainflow2Event { eventName, payload }

###